//--- Inference Queue + Model Registry (Phase 1+) ---
//Backend-agnostic priority queue for LLM inference.
//Dispatches to: LOCAL_CPU (llama.cpp), LOCAL_GPU (Xe compute),
//EXTERN_HTTP (vLLM/Claude/Ollama over network).

